<section class="section"><h2>Commercial activation rule</h2><p>Completing this page is necessary but not sufficient. Live PayPal checkout also requires completed sandbox lifecycle evidence, verified live PayPal credentials and plans, webhook verification, the production environment switch, the D1 checkout switch, the protected legal confirmation secret and the exact administrator activation phrase.</p></section>
